                "description": "This is a wide Escutcheon Plate Classroom Function Lever (Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key)  is suitable for all Wide, or Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8 inch door prep.",
